  "title": "Grandma&#39;s Creamy Potato Salad with Sour Cream",
  "description": "This amazing potato salad takes some time to make but is so worth it. It gets its creaminess from sour cream, mayonnaise, and yogurt.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennie Hood Flynn"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-10-10T21:29:24-04:00",
